    (6, "Data", "Backtest master", "One table for both fuels and all three time slices: 576 events, 12,845 snapshots (open, 10 AM, noon, 3 PM, 6 PM, 10 PM, close), 155 columns, with the 3 most liquid lines, crowd center, 73 inputs and regime labels. Lives in GitHub data/lake/master; the rulebook is inside tools/backtest_master.py. Matches the old daily panels exactly on 356 shared days.", "fuel x slice x snapshot", "Current", ""),
